# Choosing Animations: Off in Go to Command writes the setting, so after a restart the settings window shows it off.
file <<END
- Milk
END
keys :
type Animations: Off
keys <Enter>
restart
keys g,
type /anim
see Animations
see off  │
see *
keys <Esc> <Esc>
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Milk @done({today})
END
